Jugaad Design Report

Jugaad Concept

The existing wash basin is difficult to use because it is installed facing the wrong direction, making users stand awkwardly while washing their hands. Instead of reinstalling the entire basin, a 360° rotating flexible tap is attached to the existing wash basin. The tap can be adjusted toward the user, allowing comfortable handwashing from different positions. In addition, foot markings are provided to maintain an appropriate distance from the wash basin, creating a cleaner, more organized, and calmer environment by preventing crowding.

⸻

Description

The proposed Jugaad improves the usability of the incorrectly oriented wash basin without modifying the plumbing system. The flexible rotating tap allows users to direct the water flow toward themselves, making the basin accessible regardless of its fixed orientation. Foot markings indicate the ideal standing position, helping users maintain a comfortable distance while using the basin. This simple and affordable solution enhances user comfort, reduces inconvenience, and promotes an organized environment using minimal resources.

