Benefits

* Low-cost and easy-to-implement solution.
* No need to reinstall or relocate the wash basin.
* The rotating tap improves accessibility and ease of use.
* Foot markings help users maintain a proper distance while using the basin.
* Encourages an organized, calm, and less crowded environment.
* Saves installation time and plumbing costs.
* Can be adapted to existing wash basins with minimal modification.

⸻

Materials Used

* Existing wash basin
* Flexible rotating tap attachment
* Direction indicator/foot markings
* Basic plumbing connector (for the rotating tap)

⸻

Limitations

* The flexible tap may require periodic maintenance.
* It is a temporary improvement and does not permanently correct the basin’s orientation.
* Foot markings depend on users following the suggested standing position.
* The rotating tap attachment may not fit every type of wash basin without adjustment.
